# still the one this distribution is aiming at, but a machine installed with
# it froze partway through boot and never reached a login - and an init is the
# one component where a bad default cannot be recovered from without another
# medium. busybox init is what every image here has booted. Set
# A_INIT=initialization in install.conf to choose it deliberately.
